{"id":"28.9.2.2","doc":"T","title":"I2Sn Channel Control in PDM Mode","words":600,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In PDM mode, fetching data from DMA is controlled by "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_MONO"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_MONO_FST_VLD"},{"t":"text","v":", see the table below."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Please configure the two bits according to the data stored in memory, be it the single-channel or dual-channel data."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 28.9-3. Data-Fetching Control in PDM Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Data-Fetching Control Option"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"I2S_TX_MONO"}],[{"t":"text","v":"I2S_TX_MONO_FST_VLD"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Post data-fetching request to DMA at any edge of WS signal"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Stereo mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Post data-fetching request to DMA only at the second half period of WS signal"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Post data-fetching request to DMA only at the first half period of WS signal"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In PDM mode, "},{"t":"block","v":"I2S","id":"i2s"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":" channel mode is controlled by "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_CHAN_MOD"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_WS_IDLE_POL"},{"t":"text","v":", see the table below."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"**Table 28.9-4."}]},{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"I2S"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":" Channel Control in PDM Mode**"}]}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Channel Control Option"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Left Channel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Right Channel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Mode Control Field (1)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Channel Select Bit (2)"}]],"rows":[{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Stereo mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_SINGLE_DATA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":15,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_SINGLE_DATA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":16,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the left channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_SINGLE_DATA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Mono mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the value of "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_SINGLE_DATA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Transmit the right channel data"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]}],"viz":{"kind":"compare","unit":"1","log":false,"items":[{"label":"Stereo mode · Transmit the left channel data","value":0},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the left channel data","value":1},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the right channel data","value":1},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the right channel data","value":2},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the left channel data","value":2},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the value of I2S_SINGLE_DATA","value":3},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the left channel data","value":3},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the left channel data","value":4},{"label":"Mono mode · Transmit the value of I2S_SINGLE_DATA","value":4}]}},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"(1) "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_CHAN_MOD"},{"t":"text","v":" (2) "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_WS_IDLE_POL"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In PDM master mode, the WS level of I2S"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":" module is controlled by "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_WS_IDLE_POL"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The frequency of WS signal is half of BCK frequency."}]},{"n":21,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The configuration of WS signal is similar to that of BCK signal, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"28.6","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Section 28.6"}]},{"t":"text","v":" and Figure 28.9-3."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":22,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3 I2S0 also supports PCM-to-PDM output mode, in which the PCM data from DMA is converted to PDM data and then output in PDM signal format."}]},{"n":23,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_PCM2PDM_CONV_EN"},{"t":"text","v":" to enable this mode."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":24,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The register configuration for PCM-to-PDM output mode is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":25,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure 1-line PDM output format or 1-/2-line DAC output mode as the table below:"}]}]}]]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 28.9-5. PCM-to-PDM Output Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Channel Output Format"}],[{"t":"text","v":"I2S0_TX_PDM_DAC_MODE_EN"}],[{"t":"text","v":"I2S0_TX_PDM_DAC_2OUT_EN"}]],"rows":[{"n":26,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1-line PDM output format (1)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"x"}]]},{"n":27,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1-line DAC output format (2)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":28,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2-line DAC output format"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":29,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"(1) In PDM output format, SD data of two channels is sent out in one WS period."}]},{"n":30,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"(2) In DAC output format, SD data of one channel is sent out in one WS period."}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":31,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure sampling frequency and upsampling rate"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":32,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In PCM-to-PDM mode, PDM clock frequency is equal to BCK frequency."}]},{"n":33,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The relation of sampling frequency (f_Sampling) and BCK frequency is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":34,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"f_Sampling = f_BCK / OSR"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":35,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Upsampling rate (OSR) is related to I2S0_TX_PDM_SINC_OSR2 as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":36,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"OSR = I2S0_TX_PDM_SINC_OSR2 × 64"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":37,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Sampling frequency f_Sampling is related to "},{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_PDM_FS"},{"t":"text","v":" as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":38,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"f_Sampling = I2S0_TX_PDM_FS × 100"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":39,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure the registers according to needed sampling frequency, upsampling rate, and PDM clock frequency."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":40,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"PDM Channel Configuration Example"}]}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":41,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In this example, the register configuration is as follows."}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":42,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_CHAN_MOD"},{"t":"text","v":" = 2, i.e., mono mode is selected."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":43,"c":[{"t":"field","v":"I2S_TX_WS_IDLE_POL"},{"t":"text","v":" = 1, i.e., both the left channel and right channel transmit the left channel data."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":44,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Once the configuration is done, the channel data is transmitted as follows."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-28_9-3.png","alt":"Figure 28.9-3. PDM Channel Control","caption":"Figure 28.9-3. PDM Channel Control"}]}